// edit. Regenerate it from the checkout root with `jet Compiler/Toolchain/BodyCodec/Main.jet --write`.
// It stays committed: the seed builds the compiler from the checkout, and
// `jet check` reads it before any build step runs.
// Each struct and enum a checked body holds has a put, which writes its
// fields in declaration order (an enum its variant's position first), and a
// get, which reads them back in that order. The hand-written halves are in
// BodyCodecRows.jet.

